---
import EpilineCaseLayout from '../../../layouts/EpilineCaseLayout.astro';
const months=[['JAN',327,4.92],['FEB',332,4.53],['MAR',442,6.18],['APR',434,5.70],['MAY',369,6.57],['JUN',278,5.70],['JUL',509,5.64],['AUG',279,7.78]];
---
<EpilineCaseLayout title="Epiline Meta Ads case" description="2,970 Meta enquiries for Epiline from January to August 2026." eyebrow="META ADS / ACQUISITION" headline="Not a lucky" accent="month." intro="Epiline needs a reliable flow of new enquiries through changing services, offers and seasonality. We manage Meta as an always-on acquisition channel — not a short campaign." metrics={[{value:'2,970',label:'Meta enquiries · Jan–Aug 2026'},{value:'€5.85',label:'weighted average CPL'},{value:'509',label:'enquiries in July 2026'},{value:'8 mo.',label:'period shown'}]}>
<section class="case-section shell"><div class="two"><span class="eyebrow">THE JOB</span><div><h2>Keep demand moving.</h2><p class="statement">Beauty demand changes with the season. The acquisition system has to change with it without losing control of cost.</p><p>We continuously manage campaigns, offers and budget allocation around Epiline’s treatment mix. The useful result is not the cheapest isolated lead. It is the ability to generate hundreds of enquiries month after month at a controllable CPL.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="case-section accent"><div class="shell"><span class="eyebrow">JAN → AUG 2026</span><h2>Eight months.<br/>Eight real results.</h2><div class="bars">{months.map(([m,l])=><div class="bar"><i style={`height:${Number(l)/509*100}%`}></i><b>{l}</b><span>{m}</span></div>)}</div><div class="data-list">{months.map(([m,l,c])=><div class="data-row"><span>{m} 2026</span><span>{l} enquiries</span><strong>€{Number(c).toFixed(2)} CPL</strong></div>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="case-section dark"><div class="shell two"><span class="eyebrow">WHAT MATTERS</span><div><h2>Predictability beats<br/>the screenshot.</h2><p>In the strongest month shown here, Meta generated 509 enquiries. In lower-demand periods the volume changes — and that is exactly why we look at the channel as an operating system rather than a campaign.</p><p class="statement">2,970 enquiries at a weighted average CPL of €5.85.</p></div></div></section>
</EpilineCaseLayout>